From 610b3ba66e53f254ee0df6623bbdd1bec14bb45c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:22:15 -0300
